# Nothing here is needed to build or run the app.
#
# `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev` and `pnpm build:win` all work without a .env; the
# application creates and migrates its own database under Electron's userData.
# This file previously carried DATABASE_URL for Prisma, which the app no longer
# uses at all.
#
# The one variable that still matters is for MAINTAINERS publishing a release:
#
#   GH_TOKEN - a GitHub token with `repo` scope, read by `pnpm publish:win`
#              (electron-builder) to create the release and upload installers.
#              Never commit it; see docs/releasing.md.
#
# GH_TOKEN=
